ass=\"p1\"\u003eFlowfeet Heat isn’t just a foot massager—it’s your daily dose of restoration. Designed with \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ethree adjustable heat levels (up to 50°C)\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ethree-speed trigger point therapy modes\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, and \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003ethree intensity levels of compression\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, it delivers a warm, soothing, and deeply revitalizing massage experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe targeted design focuses on the \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eforefoot and arch\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, where most tension builds up, helping relieve stiffness, pain, and swelling while improving blood circulation. Ideal for those who prefer a \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003egentler and warming recovery experience\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, Flowfeet Heat combines innovation and comfort for complete foot rejuvenation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cb\u003eTherapeutic Warmth for Profound Recovery\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p3\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eAt the core of Flowfeet Heat lies its advanced \u003cspan class=\"s1\"\u003e\u003cb\u003einfrared heat technology\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e, designed to penetrate deep into your muscles—melting away fatigue and easing soreness where it matters most. The controlled warmth helps dissolve muscle stiffness and stimulates blood flow, ensuring faster recovery and long-lasting comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p2\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\